@startuml uc006-analysis-classes
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
hide empty members
hide circle
title UC-006 Run complete evaluation: analysis classes (BCE)

class "Command Line" as CLI <<boundary>> {
  run command
  show progress and totals
  exit code
}
class "Config File" as CF <<boundary>> {
  read config
}
class "Model Interface" as MI <<boundary>> {
  send prompt
}
class "Report Store" as RS <<boundary>> {
  write report
}
class "Run Evaluation" as Run <<control>> {
  run(config, output directory)
}
class "Evaluation Config" as EC <<entity>> {
  dataset
  rubric id
  output directory
}
class "Connection Profile" as CP <<entity>> {
  provider, model, base URL
  key variable name
}
class "Benchmark" as B <<entity>> {
  name
  test cases
}
class "Rubric" as R <<entity>> {
  id
  instructions
}
class "Evaluation Run" as ER <<entity>> {
  id
  start and finish times
}
class "Case Result" as CR <<entity>> {
  outcome
  error stage
}
class "Run Summary" as RSum <<entity>> {
  counts, pass rate, coverage
}

CLI --> Run : starts
Run --> CF : reads through
CF ..> EC : yields
EC --> "2" CP : target, judge
Run --> B : loads
Run --> R : looks up
Run --> MI : target and judge, via profiles
Run --> ER : creates
ER --> "1..*" CR : produces
Run --> RSum : creates
Run --> RS : writes through

note bottom of Run
  Business rule: setup problems are found
  before the first model call. An ERROR is
  never a FAIL. Exit 0 = the run completed.
end note
@enduml
